WEBVTT

00:01.770 --> 00:05.660
I... received something from Sid.

00:06.620 --> 00:07.990
He entrusted to me...

00:08.660 --> 00:10.900
these words.

00:12.210 --> 00:17.620
It exists... no, it was supposed to exist...

00:18.160 --> 00:19.850
Supposed to exist?

00:20.620 --> 00:23.290
What was he talking about?

00:25.220 --> 00:29.560
You, who touched upon the taboo code...

00:30.690 --> 00:36.580
Shatter... the hatred 
that lurks in this world!

00:41.080 --> 00:43.060
I just want to end the War of the Five Races.

00:44.030 --> 00:45.810
That is my wish.

00:47.000 --> 00:48.980
Then begone already,

00:49.620 --> 00:52.760
before the spirits and mythical beasts 
decide to make their move...

00:53.900 --> 00:58.160
Rath=IE, you are lying.

00:58.480 --> 00:59.940
I see.

00:59.940 --> 01:05.040
As a sage, you already 
understand the situation.

01:06.010 --> 01:08.680
Right here and now,

01:09.950 --> 01:12.150
the spirit race will disappear from the world!

01:24.270 --> 01:28.820
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

03:09.580 --> 03:11.960
Universal Mirroring: Ocean.

03:48.540 --> 03:49.870
You're...

03:58.380 --> 04:01.030
Good girl, Last Riser.

04:08.680 --> 04:10.310
This road sure is wide.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.810
It's the road 
the Okerachuchupurin use, after all.

04:23.220 --> 04:25.110
Okera-what now?

04:25.810 --> 04:29.490
The Okerachuchupurin. They're huge hedgehogs.

04:30.330 --> 04:32.830
They're about 10 meters wide.

04:32.830 --> 04:36.900
They rarely appear, but they could roll over 
a car and crush it to pieces if they did.

04:36.900 --> 04:37.950
What?!

04:37.950 --> 04:39.560
H-Hold on!

04:39.560 --> 04:42.580
So what happens to us if one appears?!

04:42.580 --> 04:44.510
Like I said, it'd crush us into pieces.

04:44.510 --> 04:47.300
Are you sure we should be using this road?!

04:47.680 --> 04:51.310
If we're heading south, 
this is the fastest way.

04:52.050 --> 04:54.420
I'm still not okay with this.

04:54.420 --> 04:56.650
Why is Reiren sitting next to Kai?!

04:57.340 --> 05:01.580
I'm giving directions, 
so it can't be helped. Right, Kai?

05:01.580 --> 05:07.200
Well, yeah. We're calling Reiren a professor 
from the Io Federation, after all.

05:07.980 --> 05:11.580
Um, wouldn't it cause a big 
commotion if the others found out

05:11.580 --> 05:13.400
that an elf is accompanying us?

05:13.400 --> 05:15.620
Wouldn't her ears be a dead giveaway?

05:17.330 --> 05:21.460
My garment has cognitive 
inhibition magic embedded in it.

05:22.450 --> 05:25.800
Those unaware of my identity would 
think I'm a normal human being.

05:29.320 --> 05:33.720
It just means I'm 
much more skilled than you are.

05:35.140 --> 05:38.610
Y-You just want to be next to Kai, that's all!

05:38.610 --> 05:43.760
L-Like I've said before, you have it all wrong!

05:41.960 --> 05:43.760
I'm super sure of it!

05:43.760 --> 05:46.150
Both of you, please settle down...

05:46.430 --> 05:47.700
<i>Status update.</i>

05:47.700 --> 05:49.410
<i>Vehicle units, are there any abnormalities?</i>

05:50.200 --> 05:52.740
Lead vehicle reporting. No changes here.

05:53.140 --> 05:54.310
<i>Glad to hear.</i>

05:54.900 --> 06:00.460
<i>Professor Reiren, could you tell us how much 
farther it is to the Yulun Federation?</i>

06:00.760 --> 06:06.190
If we keep this pace, I'd say we'll 
get there in three days and three nights.

06:06.190 --> 06:10.300
<i>I see. I'm relieved to hear 
things seem to be going as planned.</i>

06:10.850 --> 06:14.380
Are there any places ahead 
where we can set up camp?

06:14.380 --> 06:19.850
<i>Hmm... If we go for half a day, 
there is a place with many springs.</i>

06:19.850 --> 06:22.050
I see, then let us head there.

06:22.050 --> 06:22.730
Jeanne-sama.

06:23.150 --> 06:24.360
What is it?

06:24.360 --> 06:25.130
Over there.

06:28.650 --> 06:31.720
It's as if something has eaten away at it.

06:32.210 --> 06:34.780
I presume it's mythical beasts.

06:34.780 --> 06:37.330
But we're still in Io Federation territory.

06:44.980 --> 06:49.560
Then we should assume that 
the mythical beasts have started

06:49.560 --> 06:51.520
crossing the borders to invade.

06:57.700 --> 07:02.300
You certainly splattered 
everywhere, Rikugen Kyoko.

07:05.370 --> 07:07.610
I'm not seeing enough of you here, though.

07:07.950 --> 07:10.490
Did you really escape as just your core?

07:11.210 --> 07:12.780
I suppose it's possible

07:12.780 --> 07:15.240
for the hero of the spirits.

07:18.520 --> 07:21.580
Are you seriously heading to that place?

07:22.120 --> 07:24.220
How strange.

07:24.220 --> 07:28.000
Even if she is a hero, 
she shouldn't have been able to notice it.

07:31.420 --> 07:35.100
Ah, whatever. There'll be 
other chances soon enough.

07:37.570 --> 07:42.790
If those who have touched upon 
the taboo code are the center of the world...

07:43.270 --> 07:46.570
I wonder what kind of path they'll choose?

08:01.400 --> 08:06.510
This spring is amazing. 
It's so warm and relaxing.

08:06.510 --> 08:12.070
Yeah, it's warmed beneath the ground 
and is said to heal wounds.

08:18.080 --> 08:24.350
Um... Is it really all right for us 
to be allowed to rest first?

08:24.780 --> 08:27.670
Of course, you've earned it.

08:27.670 --> 08:31.400
You aided in defeating 
the hero of the celestials.

08:33.620 --> 08:35.730
Good job, here.

08:35.730 --> 08:37.260
Yeah, appreciate it.

08:37.850 --> 08:40.690
It must be hard being Jeanne-sama's bodyguard.

08:40.690 --> 08:41.740
Yeah, I guess.

08:48.620 --> 08:52.420
It can't be helped, considering 
we can't let anyone see, but...

08:52.900 --> 08:55.910
I wonder if those three are doing all right...

08:59.760 --> 09:02.730
Hmm, your wounds are healing.

09:02.730 --> 09:05.190
You should fully recover in no time.

09:05.190 --> 09:09.690
I see. I appreciate you healing me, Reiren.

09:23.130 --> 09:26.210
It seems you heal rather fast, too.

09:26.210 --> 09:28.290
You really are a mystery.

09:29.270 --> 09:30.880
Still...

09:33.770 --> 09:35.090
you certainly are obscene.

09:35.090 --> 09:36.030
Huh?!

09:36.690 --> 09:40.330
You have a needless abundance of 
chest and butt, like a succubus.

09:40.330 --> 09:42.140
I-I'm not obscene!

09:42.140 --> 09:44.740
You're the one that's too flat!

09:44.740 --> 09:46.590
F-Flat?!

09:46.590 --> 09:49.610
An elf's body is made perfectly 
with no wasted proportions!

09:54.290 --> 09:57.240
Could you two listen a little?

09:58.980 --> 10:01.980
I've previously spoken 
to Kai about this, but...

10:04.450 --> 10:07.310
World reincarnation, and the code holder...

10:07.740 --> 10:13.340
Yeah... To be honest, I don't 
understand most of it myself.

10:14.030 --> 10:14.990
I see...

10:17.020 --> 10:18.010
At the very least,

10:18.460 --> 10:22.510
we know that your weapon was not 
made by human hands.

10:22.510 --> 10:25.040
It might be dangerous to keep using it.

10:26.260 --> 10:29.480
Well, I'm not one to talk, I suppose.

10:29.780 --> 10:33.620
Seriously. You really push 
yourself too much, you know...

10:34.110 --> 10:37.190
Sacrificing your life energy 
to use elf magic items.

10:37.680 --> 10:40.860
I know. But I have no intention 
of changing my mind.

10:41.340 --> 10:43.490
No matter what anyone says.

10:43.490 --> 10:45.300
Yeah, I know.

10:45.910 --> 10:48.710
You've been stubborn 
ever since you were a kid, Jeanne.

10:49.050 --> 10:50.810
As I've mentioned before,

10:50.810 --> 10:54.820
I don't care where you've come from 
or whether your story is true.

10:55.450 --> 10:58.510
Whether you're beneficial 
to us in our fight or not...

10:58.510 --> 10:59.610
That's all that matters.

11:00.190 --> 11:03.700
I know. It's a natural opinion for 
a Rebel Army Commander.

11:05.140 --> 11:09.730
Furthermore, what we need 
to think about is that monster.

11:10.520 --> 11:11.980
The Last Riser...

11:12.570 --> 11:14.920
It gave Alfreya a mortal wound,

11:15.400 --> 11:18.580
and even appeared when you 
fought Vanessa, right?

11:19.140 --> 11:24.980
Yeah, but there were no records 
of that monster even in my world.

11:25.330 --> 11:27.110
Horrifying to hear.

11:28.230 --> 11:30.730
From what I've observed...

11:31.290 --> 11:35.130
I think the Last Riser 
is monitoring the heroes.

11:35.770 --> 11:40.870
And what triggers it to go from monitoring 
to assault mode is probably... "Sid."

11:42.220 --> 11:45.940
The name of the hero of the humans 
that doesn't exist in this world.

11:46.430 --> 11:51.000
I wonder what kind of relationship 
the Last Riser has with the remaining heroes.

11:51.400 --> 11:52.720
Yeah, I wonder.

11:53.190 --> 11:56.920
Are they subservient, or are they hostile...

11:57.910 --> 11:58.970
Or perhaps...

12:00.230 --> 12:03.390
Either way, all we can do is keep facing them...

12:04.180 --> 12:06.470
To end the Great War 
of the Five Races.

12:07.000 --> 12:07.750
Yeah.

12:11.380 --> 12:16.210
That's true. The monster that 
 suddenly changed Lord Alfreya...

12:16.210 --> 12:18.260
We don't know much about it.

12:19.150 --> 12:25.180
From now on, when we fight a hero, 
we need to stay alert for the Last Riser as well.

12:27.090 --> 12:30.180
I'm... scared of it.

12:31.220 --> 12:33.310
I'm not sure why, but...

12:33.970 --> 12:37.070
when I look at it, my legs give out.

12:37.570 --> 12:40.630
I become scared, and paralyzed, and...

12:46.820 --> 12:49.330
I didn't mean to frighten you. I'm sorry.

12:49.330 --> 12:50.380
It's okay.

12:53.960 --> 12:54.960
What was that?!

12:59.460 --> 13:00.960
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

13:02.460 --> 13:03.970
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

13:03.970 --> 13:05.470
Get ready over here!

13:05.470 --> 13:06.740
Make the call!

13:32.190 --> 13:34.910
It's a mythical beast... a behemoth!

13:43.020 --> 13:43.960
Take this!

13:53.820 --> 13:55.410
Let's go. Follow my lead.

13:55.410 --> 13:56.090
All right...

14:14.840 --> 14:15.660
Kai, watch out!

14:23.160 --> 14:25.040
All personnel, temporary retreat!

14:28.440 --> 14:30.890
The modified drake bullet 
didn't work on it...

14:31.640 --> 14:32.760
Could it be...

14:33.450 --> 14:37.230
it's stronger than 
the mythical beasts I know?

14:37.230 --> 14:40.120
Group eight, group nine, 
rescue the injured.

14:40.120 --> 14:42.980
Group 12, retreat and start 
preparing a relief base.

14:45.780 --> 14:46.880
Jeanne-sama!

14:48.180 --> 14:49.630
It's a mythical beast.

14:49.630 --> 14:53.490
It's probably the one that 
left those marks earlier today.

14:53.810 --> 14:54.960
How can that be?

14:55.390 --> 14:58.080
We're still in celestial territory.

14:58.780 --> 15:02.040
Just watching us... no, reconnaissance?

15:02.530 --> 15:05.000
Jeanne, an autocannon won't do.

15:05.000 --> 15:09.130
For a mythical beast that size,
 you need to use something stronger.

15:09.130 --> 15:11.190
We don't have anything bigger.

15:11.190 --> 15:15.680
We weren't expecting to fight mythical 
beasts, so it can't be helped, but...

15:16.040 --> 15:18.140
We'll buy some time.

15:18.140 --> 15:21.480
Jeanne-sama, please take the rest 
of the soldiers and retreat.

15:24.940 --> 15:27.880
Kai, how do we defeat that thing?

15:28.300 --> 15:29.110
Jeanne?

15:29.540 --> 15:34.620
If we're going to face the spirits 
and the mythical beasts,

15:34.620 --> 15:37.490
we can't be pushed back 
by an enemy of that caliber.

15:41.730 --> 15:42.910
You're right.

15:43.900 --> 15:45.040
Aim for the forehead.

15:45.870 --> 15:51.220
It's an atrophied magic organ.
 That's its vital spot.

15:51.640 --> 15:54.140
We're already aware of that.

15:54.140 --> 15:56.810
The question is how to attack it.

15:57.630 --> 16:03.270
If this is the celestial territory, 
shouldn't <i>it</i> be here, Reiren?

16:14.180 --> 16:15.740
Over here, you beast.

16:27.590 --> 16:28.670
Just a little more.

16:49.790 --> 16:52.110
It's mushroom fog spores.

16:52.110 --> 16:54.520
It shouldn't be able 
to see or smell for a while.

17:10.840 --> 17:12.090
Explode!

17:14.670 --> 17:15.470
What?

17:16.770 --> 17:17.390
Rinne!

17:31.580 --> 17:32.860
Phew...

17:34.040 --> 17:36.280
Your plan worked.

17:36.920 --> 17:40.830
It completely fell for the elven trap.

17:41.140 --> 17:43.600
Right now, it's being burnt to a crisp

17:43.600 --> 17:46.790
by the magma-like heat 
of the purgatory flower garden.

17:48.000 --> 17:49.880
Hmm? What's wrong?

17:49.880 --> 17:50.750
Kai!

17:55.650 --> 17:58.600
Kai... why...

18:00.900 --> 18:06.860
The mythical beast's magical organ is 
atrophied, but it doesn't mean it's gone.

18:07.980 --> 18:12.610
It probably detected 
your magical powers, Rinne.

18:14.180 --> 18:17.630
Such a painful wound... 
I don't want to see it.

18:18.930 --> 18:23.080
I don't like it when you're 
suffering like this, Kai...

18:25.010 --> 18:27.960
Rinne, are you hurt?

18:28.220 --> 18:29.050
No.

18:29.510 --> 18:33.060
Good. I'm glad you're all right.

18:34.060 --> 18:35.640
Kai, are you all right?!

18:36.570 --> 18:39.550
I'll stop the bleeding. 
Do you have any painkillers?

19:01.870 --> 19:03.680
<i>Awaken.</i>

19:05.450 --> 19:09.870
<i>Come to me.</i>

19:11.850 --> 19:14.190
<i>Child who is loved by fate.</i>

19:16.380 --> 19:18.870
<i>Child who was thrown away by the world</i>

19:20.610 --> 19:23.500
<i>The one who touched upon the taboo code.</i>

19:30.520 --> 19:32.840
Was that a dream?

19:34.810 --> 19:38.330
That voice... I've heard it somewhere.

19:44.280 --> 19:45.870
What's going on?

19:54.110 --> 19:58.050
Change in departure time. 
We were told to stay put for a while.

19:58.050 --> 20:00.140
What? Why?

20:00.140 --> 20:01.190
I don't know?

20:01.930 --> 20:05.460
Oh, okay... I wonder if we could 
take another dip

20:05.460 --> 20:07.010
in that warm spring.

20:07.010 --> 20:09.160
Did you get hooked on it?

20:16.460 --> 20:20.020
The building you speak of... 
I don't mind taking you there,

20:20.020 --> 20:22.630
but there's nothing special about it.

20:22.630 --> 20:24.570
There's just stone statues inside.

20:25.260 --> 20:26.700
You've been in there before?

20:27.330 --> 20:28.890
Of course I have.

20:28.890 --> 20:32.310
I always thought humans 
make the silliest things.

20:32.820 --> 20:35.300
Is it really a building made by humans?

20:35.300 --> 20:37.170
In such a remote place?

20:37.170 --> 20:39.790
It wasn't made by the celestials.

20:39.790 --> 20:42.800
Humans are the only other 
ones who could make it, no?

20:45.000 --> 20:46.140
A megalith, huh?

20:46.850 --> 20:47.970
Megalith?

20:48.870 --> 20:50.840
It's an unanalyzed spiritual ruin...

20:51.400 --> 20:54.590
A structure whose origins are 
completely unknown.

20:54.590 --> 20:57.350
There are several of them 
in the world I came from.

20:58.020 --> 21:01.030
You know one of them, Rinne.

21:01.450 --> 21:03.130
I know one of them?

21:04.040 --> 21:04.990
The graveyards.

21:07.270 --> 21:09.630
In the true history of the world,

21:09.630 --> 21:12.580
they were special buildings made 
to seal away the four races...

21:13.580 --> 21:17.880
In this world, the code holder 
was hidden there.

21:29.780 --> 21:30.810
It's this.

21:31.210 --> 21:33.120
Yes... that's right.

21:40.660 --> 21:44.030
<i>Now, come.</i>

21:45.710 --> 21:47.910
<i>What are you afraid of?</i>

21:49.080 --> 21:55.470
<i>You have finally found the center of the world,</i>

21:56.970 --> 21:59.480
<i>those chosen by fate.</i>

22:00.710 --> 22:04.000
<i>I shall welcome your visit.</i>

22:05.050 --> 22:09.970
<b>Episode 9
"The Center of the World"</b>

23:37.140 --> 23:40.020
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?
